ains, and by 1945 it was with the 38th Army of the 4th Ukrainian Front.","LocalizedString":"The 35th Rifle Regiment was part of the 30th Rifle Division of the Red Army. The division participated in multiple battles and operations during WWII, including the Battle of Rostov in 1941 and the Tuapse Defensive Operation in 1942 where it fought bravely and was promoted and renamed to the 55th Guards Rifle Division for its actions. In 1943 the division fought at Rostov, Kiev, Zhitomir, and in the Carpathian Mountains, and by 1945 it was with the 38th Army of the 4th Ukrainian Front."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isReserved":true,"usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDestroyed","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnEndOfTurn"],"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Small'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Small.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/t_soviet_infantry_g.t_soviet_infantry_g","SubPathString":""},"artist":"ITAR-TASS News Agency / Alamy Stock Photo","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/35th_RIFLE_REGIMENT.35th_RIFLE_REGIMENT","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":317.0},"historyPhotoSource":"http://nado.znate.ru/Ростовская_операция_(1941)","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_35th_rifles_photo","SourceString":"Soviet troops fighting during the Battle of Rostov, 1941.","LocalizedString":"Soviet troops fighting during the Battle of Rostov, 1941."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_35th_rifles_header","SourceString":"Infantry","LocalizedString":"Infantry"},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryS'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Niagara/NS_ExplosionInfantryS.46"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeLight_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/examples/GrenadePack/Blue